WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:05.625
You checked two emergency accounts against
Microsoft Learn's standard and found one

3
00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:09.505
that fails five ways, three enforced
policies that would lock them out,

4
00:00:09.505 --> 00:00:11.713
and a stranger in their exclusion group.

5
00:00:11.713 --> 00:00:16.038
And you built an alert that sees five
events where Learn's sample sees two.

6
00:00:16.038 --> 00:00:20.205
Carry one thing forward: before
any later lab enforces anything,

7
00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:23.900
build the emergency accounts
and confirm one can sign in.

8
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:29.675
Next is Module 3: Conditional Access for
administrators and the activation gate.

9
00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:34.494
It's the first module that writes, so it's
the first that could lock people out,

10
00:00:34.494 --> 00:00:36.204
and its first rule, C A oh one,

11
00:00:36.204 --> 00:00:40.080
keeps the emergency group
excluded from every policy file.
